  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/06/IMG_4649.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La Asociaci&oacute;n Rellamp, que engloba a los grupos musicales de Onda, ha organizado este viernes por la noche su concierto anual en el Casal Jove, con la participaci&oacute;n de Colombo y The Autan Plus Band.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertcolombotheautanplusbandcasaljove/img_4644.jpg\" alt=\"img_4644\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertcolombotheautanplusbandcasaljove/img_4645.jpg\" alt=\"img_4645\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertcolombotheautanplusbandcasaljove/img_4646.jpg\" alt=\"img_4646\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertcolombotheautanplusbandcasaljove/img_4647.jpg\" alt=\"img_4647\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertcolombotheautanplusbandcasaljove/img_4648.jpg\" alt=\"img_4648\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertcolombotheautanplusbandcasaljove/img_4649.jpg\" alt=\"img_4649\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertcolombotheautanplusbandcasaljove/img_4650.jpg\" alt=\"img_4650\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertcolombotheautanplusbandcasaljove/img_4651.jpg\" alt=\"img_4651\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertcolombotheautanplusbandcasaljove/img_4652.jpg\" alt=\"img_4652\